# The staging directory now lives under %TEMP% (see build_windows_installer.ps1),
# so nothing under packages/ should ever appear in a checkout. Kept as a
# safety net in case a legacy in-tree stage is still around locally.
packages/io.plotjuggler.application/data/
# Output produced by build_windows_installer.ps1 -OutDir <default '.'>.
# Name is <YYYY.MM.DD>.PlotJuggler-<Version>-Windows-x64.<main-commit>.exe, so the
# glob is broad enough to catch the date prefix and commit suffix.
**/*PlotJuggler-*Windows-x64*.exe
